# Input
```css
/* should not generate diagnostics */
/* The combinator sits inside `:has()`, so it does not separate the tail from
   the rest of the selector: the two rules do not target the same element. */
.b:has(> img) {
  color: red;
}

div:has(> img) {
  color: blue;
}

```
